=== Disable File Editor ===
Contributors: Nikunj Soni
Tags: security,file editor,file,editor,wp-admin,wordpress,admin,plugin,disable file,disable editor
License: GPLv2
Requires at least: 3.7
Tested up to: 6.1.1
Stable tag: 1.6

This plugin will disable file editing tool in your WordPress admin panel.

== Description ==

This plugin will disable file editing tool in your WordPress admin panel.

== Installation ==

1. Download and extract this plugin to `wp-content/plugins/`
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress and enjoy !

